WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:01.930
A whitewashed chapel.

2
00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.350
No bells.

3
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.620
The brethren kneel to pray.

4
00:00:05.670 --> 00:00:07.960
Silas Marner kneels too.

5
00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:10.340
The church will let God decide.

6
00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:12.280
A hand draws a lot.

7
00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:15.840
"The lots declared that
Silas Marner was guilty."

8
00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:21.270
Years later, bells ring over a
snowy village far away: Raveloe.

9
00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:24.320
So where does Silas find his faith again?

10
00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:28.730
In this mission, you'll see why a strict
chapel let the drawing of lots decide

11
00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.180
a man's guilt.

12
00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:33.520
You'll set it beside Raveloe's
easy-going church of bells,

13
00:00:33.570 --> 00:00:35.540
holly and old customs.

14
00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:38.700
And you'll learn how
Eliot lost her own faith.

15
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:42.440
Your mission: find out where
Silas finds his faith again.
